#==============================================================================================
#
#   style_invalidation_data_2 - CSS::StyleInvalidationData II: building the invalidation sets
#                               and plans of a selector
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/StyleInvalidationData.cpp (lines 321-587): the invalidation set of a
#       group of simple selectors, the plans of each combinator, the scope leakage of complex
#       :is()/:where()/:not() arguments inside :has(), and
#       StyleInvalidationData::build_invalidation_sets_for_selector, which the rule cache runs
#       for every selector it holds.
